WEBVTT

00:59.836 --> 01:03.579
Too bright. Too merry. Wrong. This isn't right.

01:05.800 --> 01:10.244
This isn't right. My room. My name. The nose. The

01:10.304 --> 01:14.387
nose. The system. Scratch.

01:17.269 --> 01:22.953
Can't breathe. Can't eat. Gotta get out. I'm on

01:22.973 --> 01:28.437
the brink. It's all wrong. It's all wrong. This

01:28.577 --> 01:32.051
isn't me. This isn't me!

02:05.455 --> 02:10.298
They're staring! They're watching! A mistake!

02:10.898 --> 02:15.481
I'm the mistake! Have to move! Have to pack!

02:16.821 --> 02:21.084
Can't do it again! The noise!

02:23.865 --> 02:29.576
Can't breathe! Can't think! THIS ISN'T ME!

03:17.191 --> 03:17.972
It's too much.

03:20.894 --> 03:21.755
It's too much.

03:24.618 --> 03:25.479
It's too much.

03:28.301 --> 03:31.344
It's too much. It's too much.

